  "name": "Curried Apricot Hummus",
  "subtitle": "A creamy chickpea dip with warm curry and fruit",
  "description": "Blend chickpeas with garlic, apricots, curry powder, lemon, and tahini or nut butter, then finish with fresh garnishes and serve with toasted pitta and vegetables.",
